	"data": "AR Glasses as Dev Workstation\n\nType: Hardware Research\nStatus: Research complete, recommendation made\nDate: 2026-09-04\n\nCore Idea\nUse tethered AR display glasses as a wearable monitor for coding and dev work on Star (Arch Linux, NVIDIA RTX 3070 Ti, 3x 1080p monitors). Paired with Steam Frame for VR immersion. Two-device setup: AR for presence (stay in the real world while working), VR for Room 2.0 (fully immersive spatial computing).\n\nRecommendation: RayNeo GT Max ($399)\n59° FOV (widest…",
